id: mbedtls_declare_private_identifiers
package: platform_core
label: Mbed TLS Declare Private Identifiers
description: >-
  This component enables the declarations of private legacy Mbed TLS primitives
  which will allow the user to call the private software implementations of the
  crypto algorithms that are "builtin" to TF-PSA-Crypto.
  NOTE:
  The private builtin crypto implemenattions are "software ONLY" and do not
  make use of the hardware acceleration incorporated in the Silicon Labs
  devices. The ALT plugins in Mbed TLS 3.6 (and earlier versions) that replaced
  the software implementations with hardware acceleration support are obsoleted
  and removed from Mbed TLS 4 and TF-PSA-Crypto. Hardware acceleration is only
  supported by the PSA drivers, called be the PSA Crypto API.
  Existing use cases of legacy mbedtls crypto APIs are recommended to consider
  migrating to use PSA Crypto APIs.

category: Platform|Security|PSA Crypto
quality: production
provides:
- name: mbedtls_declare_private_identifiers
requires:
- name: psa_crypto_config
template_contribution:
- name: psa_crypto_builtin_config
  value: MBEDTLS_DECLARE_PRIVATE_IDENTIFIERS
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: mbedtls_sbom
root_path: platform_core
